行自我调整，但仍有少数情况下难以释怀。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_frustration\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:13:14'),(658,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"遇到困难和挫折时，大多数情况下能够进行一些自我调整，但有时也会有些心理负担。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_frustration\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:13:33'),(659,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"对过去的失误和挫败难以释怀，缺乏必要的自我恢复和调节。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_frustration\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:13:47'),(660,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"善于控制自己的情绪和行动，情绪稳定，言行得体，自制力强。\",\"dictSort\":1,\"dictType\":\"el_emotional\",\"dictValue\":\"A\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:14:06'),(661,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"能够有效地控制自己的行为，极少出现轻率或冲动的表现。\",\"dictSort\":2,\"dictType\":\"el_emotional\",\"dictValue\":\"B\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:14:19'),(662,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"通常能够控制情绪与行为，抵制冲动，但偶尔会因情绪波动而稍显失控。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_emotional\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:14:33'),(663,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"大多数情况下能够有意识地控制自身的情绪及行为，但有时会受到情绪驱动，表现出冲动行为。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_emotional\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:14:48'),(664,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"情绪易于起伏，波动较大，缺乏自我节制的能力，言行易受情绪影响。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_emotional\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:15:02'),(665,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"认知能力强，反应敏捷，分析问题有条不紊，能迅速识别关键信息并作出判断。\",\"dictSort\":1,\"dictType\":\"el_cognitive_decline\",\"dictValue\":\"A\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:15:22'),(666,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"记忆和思维能力状况良好，注意力较集中，很少出现思维紊乱的现象。\",\"dictSort\":2,\"dictType\":\"el_cognitive_decline\",\"dictValue\":\"B\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:15:35'),(667,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"记忆与思维能力基本正常，但偶尔会感到记忆力减退、思维能力下降。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_cognitive_decline\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:15:50'),(668,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"在多数情况下，个体的记忆力和注意力表现尚可，但有时会出现思维速度稍慢，思考问题不够清晰。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_cognitive_decline\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:16:41'),(669,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"记忆力有所减弱，难以长时间维持注意力，思维反应稍显迟缓。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_cognitive_decline\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:16:57'),(670,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"身体状况极佳，总是保持精神焕发，拥有充足的精力来应对工作。\",\"dictSort\":1,\"dictType\":\"el_feeling_unwell\",\"dictValue\":\"A\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:17:16'),(671,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"对自己的身体状况感到满意，精力充沛，很少出现精力不济、身心疲惫的情况。\",\"dictSort\":2,\"dictType\":\"el_feeling_unwell\",\"dictValue\":\"B\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:17:29'),(672,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"通常能够以良好的状态投入工作，身体没有明显的不适感，但偶尔仍会有些许疲惫感。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_feeling_unwell\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:17:41'),(673,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"工作投入，但有时感到精力不济，疲惫劳累，还会有些身体不适。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_feeling_unwell\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:17:54'),(674,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"身体经常有明显的不适感，感到精疲力尽，甚至出现心力交瘁的情况。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_feeling_unwell\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:18:06'),(675,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"内心安宁，心境自然，面对问题时能够坦然处之。\",\"dictSort\":1,\"dictType\":\"el_fear\",\"dictValue\":\"A\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:18:24'),(676,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"内心安定平和，安全感较强，很少感受到恐惧情绪。\",\"dictSort\":2,\"dictType\":\"el_fear\",\"dictValue\":\"B\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:18:35'),(677,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"通常能够保持一定的安全感，冷静平和，但有时内心也有些许隐忧，担心出现意外和失误。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_fear\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:18:47'),(678,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"大多数情况下有一定的安全感，但有时会担心出现意外和工作失误。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_fear\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:19:00'),(679,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"缺乏安全感，经常出现莫名的恐惧情绪，频繁出现担忧与害怕的心理感受。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_fear\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:19:12'),(680,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"为人友善宽容，信任他人，能够站在他人的角度思考问题，并对他人的缺点和错误持以宽容的态度。\",\"dictSort\":1,\"dictType\":\"el_enmity\",\"dictValue\":\"A\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:19:32'),(681,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"与人为善，能够与他人建立良好的社交关系，善意地理解他人的动机和行为，很少发生争执。\",\"dictSort\":2,\"dictType\":\"el_enmity\",\"dictValue\":\"B\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:19:43'),(682,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"通常能够与人和睦相处，但偶尔会以挑剔的眼光看待周围的人和事。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_enmity\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:19:54'),(683,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"大多时候能够与人和平相处，但有时会对他人表现出冷漠或怀疑的态度。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_enmity\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:20:06'),(684,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"在人际交往中展现出较强的防御心理和自我保护意识，有时会表现出一些不合作的态度。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_enmity\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:20:20'),(685,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"知足常乐，能够正确看待得失和成败，善于调整自我心态，对现实状况和各种变化能够坦然待之。\",\"dictSort\":1,\"dictType\":\"el_psychological_imbalance\",\"dictValue\":\"A\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:20:39'),(686,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"对于自身的付出和所得总体上感到满意，心态相对平衡，较少出现怨天尤人的现象。\",\"dictSort\":2,\"dictType\":\"el_psychological_imbalance\",\"dictValue\":\"B\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:20:48'),(687,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"基本上能够适应当前状况，不会过分追求自身利益，但在面对某些不公平现象时，偶尔会表现出一定的不满情绪。\",\"dictSort\":3,\"dictType\":\"el_psychological_imbalance\",\"dictValue\":\"C\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:21:02'),(688,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"大多数情况下能够接受现况，但当主观愿望与客观现实之间存在较大差距时，会出现一些怨气，觉得自己付出多而得到少。\",\"dictSort\":4,\"dictType\":\"el_psychological_imbalance\",\"dictValue\":\"D\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:21:13'),(689,'字典数据',1,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysDictDataController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/dict/data','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"createBy\":\"admin\",\"dictLabel\":\"经常感受到自身投入与回报之间的不平衡，内心产生不满情绪，怨天尤人。\",\"dictSort\":5,\"dictType\":\"el_psychological_imbalance\",\"dictValue\":\"E\",\"listClass\":\"default\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:21:25'),(690,'用户',1,'com.ruoyi.web.modules.candidate.controller.CandidateController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/exam/api/candidate/save','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"age\":33,\"createTime\":\"2024-06-05T17:23:04.095+08:00\",\"examId\":\"1793116860686794753\",\"gender\":\"1\",\"id\":\"1717579384094\",\"name\":\"小四\",\"params\":{},\"telephone\":\"19922890589\"}','{\"code\":0,\"data\":{\"age\":33,\"createTime\":\"2024-06-05T17:23:04.095+08:00\",\"examId\":\"1793116860686794753\",\"gender\":\"1\",\"id\":\"1717579384094\",\"name\":\"小四\",\"params\":{},\"telephone\":\"19922890589\"},\"msg\":\"操作成功！\",\"success\":true}',0,NULL,'2024-06-05 17:23:04'),(691,'用户',1,'com.ruoyi.web.modules.candidate.controller.CandidateController.update()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/exam/api/candidate/update